# Template for clients/field-app/.env
#
# Copy this file to .env (same directory) and uncomment one of the URLs. `.env*` is
# in `.gitignore` so your local override stays out of git.
#
# Hosts:
#   - 10.0.2.2:5282          Android emulator → host's loopback.
#   - 100.101.240.44:5282    Tailscale IP of `joeman-laptop-1` (the backend host).
#
# The EAS profiles (`development`, `preview`, `production` in clients/field-app/eas.json)
# bake their own EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL into the APK — this file is only for local dev
# via `npx expo start`.

# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://10.0.2.2:5282
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://100.101.240.44:5282